          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What are the common complaints about XO Jacqui?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The main complaints are price and dose: about $3.78 per 25 g of protein, with only 15 g per scoop. One reviewer reported bloating despite the brand's claims about reducing it, and rice protein generally can feel slightly gritty in water. The Amazon listing showed no live price when we checked, so availability there may be patchy."
          }
